OL,3,ATraitors star burgled after sharing
OL,4,Aholiday photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraitors star Paul Gorton did not think
OL,7,Ftwice about sharing photographs on
OL,8,Fsocial media while enjoying a family
OL,9,Fholiday with his wife and two young
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FBut when he returned home he discovered
OL,13,Fthat his house in Cheshire had been
OL,14,Fburgled just days earlier.
OL,16,F"The eerie bit is at 21:10 BST I posted
OL,17,Fthat me and Kate were by the side of
OL,18,Fthe pool, we've got full bellies, the
OL,19,Fkids are in bed, we're actually having
OL,20,Four little bit of the holiday," he
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
